158
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:45,330
So we say that promise.all short circuits

159
00:09:45,330 --> 00:09:47,620
when one promise rejects.

160
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:50,800
So again, because one rejected promise

161
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:54,860
